            <h3 class="why-title">What is Our Mission?</h3>
            <p class="why-text">To deliver world-class, affordable, and innovative housing solutions across Bangladesh — providing every family and business with access to quality construction built on the pillars of integrity, safety, and excellence. We aim to be the most trusted EPC housing company, creating lasting value for all stakeholders through innovation and commitment.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-card reveal glass-card" data-aos="fade-up" style="--i:1;text-align:left">
            <div class="why-icon" style="margin:0 0 var(--space-5)" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></div>
            <h3 class="why-title">What is Our Vision?</h3>
            <p class="why-text">To become South Asia's most respected prefab and real estate company — recognized globally for transforming the housing landscape with cutting-edge technology, sustainable construction practices, and an uncompromising dedication to client satisfaction. We envision a Bangladesh where quality housing is accessible to all.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

